    '记录目标': 'Record the target',
    'ImportPath 让集合只服务于一个 package；PackageName 供生成代码使用。': 'ImportPath limits the set to one package; PackageName is used by generated code.',
    '检查有效性': 'Check validity',
    'IsValid 只有在至少有一种规则时才返回 true。': 'IsValid returns true only when at least one rule category is present.',
    '同名函数可以对应多条规则，但键是函数名。': 'Several rules may target functions with the same name, but the key is the function name.',
    '结构体规则使用另一张表，执行时按类型分派。': 'Struct rules use another table and are dispatched by type during execution.',
