    '为什么一个 package 选择一个 rule set？': 'Why does one package select one rule set?',
    'match 明确返回第一个匹配集合；集合内部再容纳不同类型规则，避免跨 package 混用。': 'match explicitly returns the first matching set; that set can contain different rule types without mixing rules across packages.',
