    '规则优先级和版本区间怎样决定命中？': 'How do rule priority and version ranges determine a match?',
    '本函数只按 import path 精确选择第一个集合；版本范围应在更早筛选阶段处理，不能凭此函数推断更多优先级。': 'This function selects only the first set with an exact import-path match; version ranges belong to an earlier filtering stage, so this function does not establish additional priority.',
    '进入 AST 插桩总流程': 'Enter the full AST instrumentation flow',
    'AST 插桩总流程：先文件，再函数和结构体': 'AST instrumentation flow: files first, then functions and structs',
    'instrument 按文件分组规则，先应用可能新增文件的规则，再解析目标文件一次，最后按具体规则类型改写 AST/DST。': 'instrument groups rules by file, applies rules that may add files first, parses each target file once, and then rewrites the AST/DST by concrete rule type.',
    'AST 是源码的树形结构：函数、参数、return 都是节点。改树比字符串替换更能保留语法结构和格式信息。': 'An AST is a tree-shaped representation of source code: functions, parameters, and return statements are nodes. Editing the tree preserves syntax and formatting better than string replacement.',
    '编译 action 匹配': 'Compile-action matching',
    '把源码表示成节点树的语法结构。': 'Represent source code as a tree of syntax nodes.',
    '保留更多源码位置/装饰信息的 Go 语法树库。': 'A Go syntax-tree library that preserves more source positions and decoration.',
