    '只用 Go 标准库，理解返回值和执行记录分别解决什么问题。无需先安装 LoongSuite。': 'Use only the Go standard library to understand the different purposes of return values and execution records. No prior LoongSuite installation is needed.',
    'plain result 与 observed result 都是 3，后者额外有 observe: start / end 和耗时；这里只手写记录，没有 OTel Span。': 'Both plain result and observed result are 3. The observed version also logs observe: start / end and elapsed time. These are handwritten records, with no OTel Span.',
