    '业务动作仍然调用 addOne；增加的代码负责观察。自动插桩要解决的是把类似观察动作重复接入大量调用的工作。': 'The application still calls addOne; the added code observes that call. Automatic instrumentation handles the repetitive work of attaching similar observation to many calls.',
    '上下文不会自动穿过任务交接': 'Context does not automatically cross task handoffs',
    '用标准库 context 中的教学标识，比较显式 ctx、新协程、预创建 worker。此处字符串标识不是 OTel Span，真实 Span 在后续实验中验证。': 'Use a teaching identifier in the standard-library context to compare explicit ctx handoff, new goroutines, and pre-created workers. The string identifier here is not an OTel Span; later labs verify real Spans.',
    '显式交接能读取 trace-request；Background 没有该值，打印 <root>。': 'An explicit handoff can read trace-request; Background has no such value and prints <root>.',
    '让两个请求并发提交任务，分别保存自己的 ctx，检查有没有串值。': 'Have two requests submit tasks concurrently, each carrying its own ctx, and check that values do not leak between them.',
    'worker 的创建早于任务。应在任务结构中携带 context，而不是依赖创建时闭包。context 是安全共享接口，但你放进 Value 的可变对象仍需同步。': 'The worker is created before the task. Carry context in the task structure rather than relying on a closure captured when the worker was created. The context interface is safe to share, but mutable objects stored through Value still need synchronization.',
    '把“插一行”变成结构化改写': 'Turn “insert a line” into a structured rewrite',
    '使用 go/parser、go/ast、go/format 解析并为目标 FuncDecl 插入 defer observe()。这是 AST 机制实验，不是 LoongSuite 的完整 trampoline。': 'Use go/parser, go/ast, and go/format to parse code and insert defer observe() into the target FuncDecl. This lab demonstrates the AST mechanism; it does not implement LoongSuite’s full trampoline.',
    '输出的 Handle 函数内出现 defer observe()；注释/字符串里的同名文本不会变成目标声明。': 'The resulting Handle function contains defer observe(); occurrences of the same name in comments or strings are not treated as target declarations.',
    '只对一个指定 receiver 的方法命中；让同名普通函数保持不变。': 'Match only the method with a specified receiver, leaving an ordinary function with the same name unchanged.',
