    '亲手包装一次真实 Go 编译': 'Wrap an actual Go compilation yourself',
    '编译 wrapper，再让 go build 的 compiler/linker 经过它；保留标准输入、输出、错误及退出码。': 'Compile a wrapper, then route the compiler/linker invocations from go build through it, preserving standard input, output, error, and exit codes.',
    '程序输出 compiled through -toolexec；toolexec.log 中能看到工具版本探测和编译/链接命令。': 'The program prints compiled through -toolexec; toolexec.log shows tool-version probes and compile/link commands.',
    '故意让 wrapper 返回非零，观察 go build 是否正确失败；随后恢复。': 'Deliberately make the wrapper return a nonzero exit code, verify that go build fails as expected, then restore it.',
    '-V=full 是版本探测的一部分，不能乱改 stdout。观测日志写文件或 stderr，真实工具路径与剩余参数原样转发。不默认清空全局 GOCACHE。': '-V=full is part of version probing, so do not alter stdout arbitrarily. Write observation logs to a file or stderr, and forward the real tool path and remaining arguments unchanged. Do not clear the global GOCACHE by default.',
    '从 JSON 规则走到真实 OnEnter / OnExit': 'From JSON rules to real OnEnter / OnExit calls',
    '固定上游工具为 net/http 调用插入一个自定义 hook，比较普通二进制和插桩二进制。此实验保留原业务结果，不修改网络环境。': 'Use the pinned upstream tool to insert a custom hook into net/http calls, then compare ordinary and instrumented binaries. This lab preserves the original application results and leaves the network environment unchanged.',
    '普通版本返回 plain-result 42 status 204；真实插桩额外输出 hook-enter method=GET、hook-exit status=204，原结果保持一致。脚本逐项断言输出，失败以非零退出。完整配置与执行记录在实验包。': 'The ordinary version returns plain-result 42 status 204. Real instrumentation additionally prints hook-enter method=GET and hook-exit status=204 while preserving the original result. The script asserts each output and exits nonzero on failure. The lab bundle includes the full configuration and execution records.',
    '在复制的实验分支中用 SetParam/SetReturnVal 改结果，再增加断言证明它确实影响调用者；最后恢复只读 hook。': 'In a copy of the lab branch, use SetParam/SetReturnVal to change the result, then add assertions proving that the caller sees the change. Finally restore the read-only hook.',
    '先跑通规则命中、签名、链接和 enter/exit 生命周期，再改行为。只看到 JSON 解析成功或 plain 输出，不代表自动插桩成功。': 'First verify rule matching, signatures, linking, and the enter/exit lifecycle, then change behavior. Successful JSON parsing or plain output alone does not prove that automatic instrumentation worked.',
    '把教学标识换成真正的 OTel Span': 'Replace the teaching identifier with a real OTel Span',
    '用内存 exporter 验证 TraceID、ParentSpanID、上下文与采样，不依赖远端 Collector。': 'Use an in-memory exporter to verify TraceID, ParentSpanID, context, and sampling without a remote Collector.',
    '显式父 context 的 child 同 Trace，Background 新根；传播 carrier 后消费端保留因果。具体断言见实验源码和执行记录。': 'A child with an explicit parent context shares its Trace; Background creates a new root. Propagating the carrier preserves causality at the consumer. See the lab source and execution records for the exact assertions.',
    '切换为未采样父上下文，观察有效 TraceID 与已导出 Span 的区别。': 'Switch to an unsampled parent context and observe the difference between a valid TraceID and an exported Span.',
    'Context 中的 SpanContext、SDK 记录和 exporter 输出是三个独立层次，必须分别断言。': 'SpanContext in Context, SDK recording, and exporter output are three separate layers that need separate assertions.',
    '亲自提取 W3C、B3 单头与多头': 'Extract W3C, B3 single-header, and B3 multi-header context yourself',
    '使用真实 OTel propagator，固定合法 ID，逐项断言冲突输入和旧单头残留。这里模拟载体，没有连接真实网关。': 'Use real OTel propagators with fixed valid IDs to assert behavior for conflicting inputs and stale single-header values. The carrier is simulated here; no real gateway is connected.',
    'B3 最后覆盖 W3C；有效 B3 单头优先多头；旧单头未清理时 parent 仍旧，清理后连接新的出站 SpanID。相同 TraceID 不保证父节点正确。': 'B3 runs last and overrides W3C; a valid B3 single header takes precedence over multiple headers. A stale single header keeps the old parent until it is removed; after removal, the parent connects to the new outbound SpanID. A shared TraceID does not guarantee the correct parent.',
    '把 B3 移到 W3C 前，再让两种格式提供不同 TraceID；比较胜出者。': 'Move B3 before W3C, give the two formats different TraceIDs, and compare which one wins.',
    '组合传播器按顺序更新 context。B3 的注入编码只控制写出格式，不会禁止读取单头，也不会自动删除旧头。实验对每一行同时检查 TraceID、SpanID 和远程标志。': 'Composite propagators update context in order. B3’s injection encoding controls only the format written; it neither disables single-header extraction nor automatically removes old headers. The lab checks TraceID, SpanID, and the remote flag together for every case.',
